+// Surgical adapter contracts: real UI leases, canonical coverage and comparison math.
+// Data/read-port fixtures below are explicit unit observations, not an installed
+// journey, a C08 durability claim, seeds for E2E, or a substitute for the five UI cases.
+type StoredScenario = Extract<StoredDecisionResult, { kind: "scenario" }>
